234 |         Retrieve the restrictions cache for a given plugin instance.
235 | 
236 |         This method checks if the plugin class can be cached globally. This is the case if the
237 |         plugin restrictions only depend on template and placeholder slot as described by the
238 |         CMS_PLACEHOLDER_CONF setting.
239 | 
240 |         If it can, it retrieves the appropriate restrictions cache based on the template and slot
241 |         of the plugin instance's placeholder. If not, it returns the (local) request cache which will
242 |         be recalculated for each request.
243 | 
244 |         Args:
245 |             request_cache (dict): The current request cache.
246 |             instance (CMSPluginBase): The plugin instance for which to retrieve the restrictions cache.
247 |             page (Optional[Page]): The page associated with the plugin instance, if any.
248 | 
249 |         Returns:
250 |             dict: The restrictions cache for the given plugin instance - or the cache valid for the request.
251 |         """
252 |         plugin_class = self.get_plugin(instance.plugin_type)
253 |         if not self.can_cache_globally(plugin_class):
254 |             return request_cache
255 |         slot = instance.placeholder.slot
256 |         if self.global_template_restrictions:
257 |             template = plugin_class._get_template_for_conf(page)
258 |         else:
259 |             template = ""
260 | 
