501 | 
502 |         :param plugin: Plugin to move
503 |         :type plugin: :class:`cms.models.pluginmodel.CMSPlugin` instance
504 |         :param int target_position: The plugin's new position
505 |         :param  target_placeholder: Placeholder to move plugin to (or ``None``)
506 |         :type target_placeholder: :class:`cms.models.placeholdermodel.Placeholder` instance
507 |         :param target_plugin: New parent plugin (or ``None``). The target plugin must be in the same placeholder
508 |            or in the ``target_placeholder`` if one is given.
509 |         :type target_plugin: :class:`cms.models.pluginmodel.CMSPlugin` instance
510 | 
511 |         The ``target_position`` is enumerated from the start of the palceholder's plugin tree (1) to
512 |         the last plugin (*n*, where *n* is the number of plugins in the placeholder).
513 |         """
514 | 
515 |         if target_placeholder:
516 |             return self._move_plugin_to_placeholder(
